0..74 Comment "// A name spelled as a lexical class, `number` or `constructor`, is a name"
75..151 Comment "// wherever a name is read: a field, a parameter, a pattern\'s binder and the"
152..230 Comment "// variable that reads it back. Before the fix a pattern read such a binder as"
231..276 Comment "// a token of the class, a malformed literal."
